{"title": "Blindsight", "pageid": 4346, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Blindsight", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Darkness.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp/300px-Generic_Darkness.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp/300px-Generic_Darkness.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Blindsight</b> is a passive feature that allows a creature to perceive its surroundings without sight. As an example, the <a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\">Strange Ox</a> has Blindsight.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature can perceive its surroundings without relying on sight. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Claw\" title=\"Crawling Claw\">Crawling Claw</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fetid_Ooze\" title=\"Fetid Ooze\">Fetid Ooze</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Shadow_Creeper\" title=\"Giant Shadow Creeper\">Giant Shadow Creeper</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greaseball\" title=\"Greaseball\">Greaseball</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hook_Horror\" title=\"Hook Horror\">Hook Horror</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hook_Horror_Spore_Servant\" title=\"Hook Horror Spore Servant\">Hook Horror Spore Servant</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Devourer\" title=\"Intellect Devourer\">Intellect Devourer</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Devourer_(Weakened)\" title=\"Intellect Devourer (Weakened)\">Intellect Devourer (Weakened)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Glutton\" title=\"Intellect Glutton\">Intellect Glutton</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Itchy\" title=\"Itchy\">Itchy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ochre_Jelly\" title=\"Ochre Jelly\">Ochre Jelly</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Scratchy\" title=\"Scratchy\">Scratchy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Creeper\" title=\"Shadow Creeper\">Shadow Creeper</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\">Strange Ox</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Us\" title=\"Us\">Us</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Grants immunity to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(status_group)\" title=\"Blinded (status group)\">Blinded</a></span> status group and prevents disadvantage against targets affected by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blur\" title=\"Blur\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Blur_Icon.webp/25px-Blur_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Blur_Icon.webp/38px-Blur_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Blur_Icon.webp/50px-Blur_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blur\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Blur_Icon.webp/25px-Blur_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Blur_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blur\" title=\"Blur\">Blur</a> spell.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714220944\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 858/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4621/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2794/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1174/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643599/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.942      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.942      1 -total\n 32.03%   10.232      2 Template:Icon_text\n 30.00%    9.584      1 Template:Condition_type\n 27.65%    8.833      4 Template:Trim\n 22.49%    7.183      2 Template:Ifempty\n 13.91%    4.442      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.95%    4.137      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.61%    3.710      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 10.44%    3.336      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4346-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714220944 and revision id 369816. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}